---
description: Tags and Locals Standards
globs: ["**/*.pp"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When defining tags and locals:

1. Common Tags Structure:
```hcl
locals {
  service_common_tags = merge(local.aws_cloudtrail_log_detections_common_tags, {
    folder  = "ServiceName"
    service = "AWS/ServiceName"
  })
}
```

2. Tag Requirements:
- Always include folder and service tags
- Use MITRE ATT&CK IDs where applicable
- Maintain consistent tag structure across files
- Use merge() for combining tags
- Keep tags organized and minimal 
